Just as a side note, I was the one who added the NDEBUG case there.
In at least one model I was working with, this check was showing up on
the profile taking around 15% of the time if memory serves.

While it's true that vectorization, new varis, etc are going to make a
bigger dent where those things are a bottleneck, it's also true that
for some classes of models we're starting to see checks like this one
in the profiles.

Cheers,
Marcus

