From: u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com (Bob Carpenter)
Date: Thu, 11 Apr 2013 03:48:33 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-dev] Testing Private/Protected Methods
Message-ID: <rulNa1MhRDI.xHJuYZqzXsgJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <rulNa1MhRDI.7hj6V1tQoBgJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
References: <rulNa1MhRDI.7hj6V1tQoBgJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
