This does not fix my issue as there are other places where (clan)g++ says that size_type is not defined.

But I moved including stan_fit.hpp from before the generated model file to the end of it and it works for now.  In detail, suppose stan_model.cpp is the file generated by stanc.  The one file that gets compiled in rstan is the following.  Before, it looks like

#include <stan_fit.hpp>
// and the content of stan_model.cpp

Now, I changed to

// the content of stan_model.cpp
#include <stan_fit.hpp>

Thanks a lot.  And if needed, the reordering can be retracted.

