From ua5e83218c834e013 at groups.google.com  Sun Apr 21 01:52:46 2013
From: ua5e83218c834e013 at groups.google.com (Michael Betancourt)
Date: Sun, 21 Apr 2013 01:52:46 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-dev] command structure & adaptation params
Message-ID: <t01q3EUptPQ.Zrzmq54jQmMJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
