Just about everything seems to interact badly with
templates.

The last error in the model that wouldn't compile is because
of namespace and template specialization interactions.
It tried to cast an int to a var rather than to a double.
The fix of course is more templating :-)

This should all be done by end of tomorrow, but I'm going to
have to go back through every function that specifies
a double and template it out so it matches int better
than var matches int.

- Bob

